# Bot2: Island, then the land creature Dryad Arbor, which is a creature card) and puts that card onto the battlefield, then
# shuffles (CR 701.20, 701.24). Each library keeps the revealed non-matching cards. The land is not a legal target while
# an artifact is (the refusal), the cost is exactly {X}{R}{R}{R} = 5 of the 6 mana available, leaving {R}.

